# Day 39/60 — AI PDF Splitter & Merger

## Objective

Today I built an AI PDF Splitter & Merger, an interactive web application that enables users to split PDF files, merge multiple PDFs, preview documents, and download processed files through a simple and intuitive interface.

The goal was to create a practical productivity tool that makes document management faster and more efficient.

---

## What Was Generated

- AI PDF Splitter & Merger
- PDF Splitting Tool
- PDF Merging Tool
- Document Preview
- Download Processed PDFs
- Responsive HTML Application

